<title>USA: General Scanning unveils new laser.</title>
<headline>General Scanning unveils new laser.</headline>
<dateline>WATERTOWN, Mass. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Securities Inc said on Tuesday that it developed a new laser marker system, the DM1100, for industrial and electronic market applications.</p>
<p>General Scanning said in a news release that its new system offers a 6.5W YAG laser with an output at an optical wavelength of 1064nm, and is compatible with existing applications.</p>
<p>General Scanning makes laser systems for the semiconductor, electronics, aircraft and medical industries.</p>
